        "id": 1889142
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-24T16:34:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "BluetoothA2dpSink.disconnect() requires only BLUETOOTH_CONNECT. But BluetoothMapClient.disconnect() and BluetoothPbapClient.disconnect()\n  require both BLUETOOTH_CONNECT and BLUETOOTH_PRIVILEGED. All four disconnect() methods are gated by the same disconnect_api flag and all\n  promoted to @SystemApi together. The permission model should be consistent across profiles. Either A2dpSink should also require\n  BLUETOOTH_PRIVILEGED, or the others are over-requiring it.",
      "revId": "40a76a578214dc53ac06e8c544d3bb72d8de8908",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
