      "writtenOn": "2026-05-24T16:34:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "log(\"disconnect(\" + device + \")\") logs the full BluetoothDevice.toString() which includes the MAC address. For a method being promoted to\n  system API where third-party system apps can call it, consider using device.getAnonymizedAddress() to avoid leaking MAC addresses into logs\n  that system apps might have access to.",
